    "graph_baselines_mechanism": "For directed Common Neighbours, Adamic-Adar, and Jaccard, cold-start users have empty outgoing training neighborhoods (N_out=0), yielding identically 0.0 scores for all candidates. Residual ranking is determined strictly by deterministic tie-breaking (lexicographical username ordering)."
